  "Pulsing circles": "脈動圓圈",
  "Put your favorite actions on the four buttons of your Turn Touch remote.\n\nPair a Turn Touch Bluetooth remote with your Android phone or tablet, then choose what each button does. Control compatible lights, adjust your music, and combine several actions into a single press.\n\nMAKE EACH BUTTON YOURS\n• Choose actions for single taps, double taps, and holds.\n• Use 12-action or 16-action layouts.\n• Run several actions from one button.\n• See your remote’s connection status and battery level.\n\nLIGHTS AND MUSIC\nConfigure compatible Philips Hue and Nanoleaf lights, select rooms and scenes, adjust brightness, or randomize Hue colors. Connect compatible Sonos speakers for music controls. Additional connection options include Govee, Kasa, WeMo, Bose, IFTTT, and custom HTTP commands; supported functions and setup requirements vary by device and service.\n\nBUILT FOR YOUR REMOTE\nA guided pairing flow and illustrated walkthrough help you get started. The app keeps listening for your paired remote in the background using Android’s connected-device service. Bluetooth range, permissions, and your phone’s battery settings affect availability.\n\nTry the offline demo to explore sample remote actions without hardware or an account. Demo commands are simulated and do not control real devices.\n\nA Turn Touch remote is required for physical-button control and is sold separately. Compatible smart-home hardware, local network access, and sometimes a third-party account or API key are needed for integrations. This app does not provide Apple HomeKit, Google Home, Nest, or remote firmware updates.\n\nNo Turn Touch account, ads, or subscription is required.\n\nLearn more: https://turntouch.com\nSupport: samuel@turntouch.com": "將喜愛的功能設為 Turn Touch 遙控器上的四個按鈕。\n\n將 Turn Touch Bluetooth 遙控器與 Android 手機或平板配對，再選擇各按鈕的功能。操控相容燈具、調整音樂，或將多個動作組合成一次按鍵操作。\n\n自訂每個按鈕\n• 設定單按、連按兩下與長按的功能。\n• 使用 12 或 16 個動作的配置。\n• 一個按鈕即可執行多個動作。\n• 查看遙控器連線狀態與電池電量。\n\n燈光與音樂\n設定相容的 Philips Hue 和 Nanoleaf 燈具，選擇房間與場景、調整亮度，或隨機切換 Hue 顏色。連線相容的 Sonos 喇叭以控制音樂。其他連線選項包括 Govee、Kasa、WeMo、Bose、IFTTT 和自訂 HTTP 指令；支援的功能與設定需求依裝置和服務而異。\n\n專為您的遙控器打造\n引導式配對流程和圖解說明協助您快速上手。App 會透過 Android 的已連線裝置服務，在背景持續搜尋已配對的遙控器。藍牙範圍、權限和手機電池設定都會影響可用性。\n\n試用離線示範，無需硬體或帳戶即可探索遙控器功能範例。示範指令僅供模擬，不會控制實際裝置。\n\n使用實體按鈕控制需另購 Turn Touch 遙控器。整合功能需要相容的智慧家庭硬體、區域網路存取，有時也需要第三方帳戶或 API 金鑰。本 App 不提供 Apple HomeKit、Google Home、Nest 或遙控器韌體更新功能。\n\n無需 Turn Touch 帳戶，沒有廣告，也不需訂閱。\n\n了解更多：https://turntouch.com\n支援：samuel@turntouch.com",
