  "Turn Touch": "Turn Touch",
  "Turn Touch for Android · {0}": "Turn Touch for Android · {0}",
  "Turn Touch for Android — Privacy Policy\nEffective October 16, 2026\n\nTurn Touch for Android connects your Turn Touch Bluetooth remote to actions you configure on your phone or tablet. You do not need a Turn Touch account to use the app.\n\nInformation on your device\n\nRemote names, Bluetooth addresses, battery readings, button assignments, and connection settings are stored on your device. Integration credentials are encrypted with an Android Keystore key. Automatic Android backup is disabled. The app keeps recent connection and action diagnostics locally; it does not send them to Turn Touch.\n\nConnections you choose\n\nThe app sends commands to the smart-home devices and services you configure. These may include Hue, Nanoleaf, Sonos, Govee, Kasa, WeMo, Bose, IFTTT, and your own HTTP endpoints. Depending on the integration, commands travel over your local network or to a provider's cloud service. Requests may include device identifiers, authentication credentials, action settings, or webhook values you provide. These providers handle requests under their own privacy policies. Some local devices use unencrypted HTTP or local network protocols; use them only on a trusted network.\n\nWeb content\n\nPages you open inside the app connect directly to those websites. They may use cookies and receive your IP address, browser information, and any information you enter. Their privacy policies apply. Turn Touch does not receive your browsing content.\n\nPermissions and media\n\nNearby-device permissions allow Bluetooth discovery and connection. Android 11 and earlier require location permission for Bluetooth scanning; Turn Touch does not obtain GPS location. A foreground-service notification keeps a paired remote available while the app is in the background. Camera permission is optional and used only for the camera feature. Photos and silent videos you capture are saved to your device's media library, not uploaded by Turn Touch. The app can also adjust media volume and send alarm requests to your selected alarm app.\n\nNo advertising or analytics\n\nTurn Touch for Android includes no advertising, analytics, tracking, or automatic crash-reporting SDK. We do not sell your information or receive a copy of your remote configuration, credentials, or captured media.\n\nYour choices\n\nYou can remove paired remotes, change integration settings, and revoke permissions in Android Settings. Clearing the app's storage or uninstalling it removes its saved configuration and credentials. Photos and videos saved to your media library remain until you delete them there. Any data sent to a third-party service is subject to that provider's retention and deletion controls.\n\nChildren\n\nThis app is intended for a general audience and is not directed to children under 13. Turn Touch does not knowingly collect children's personal information through this Android app.\n\nChanges and contact\n\nThis policy applies to Turn Touch for Android version 1.0. We will update the policy if the app's data practices change. For privacy questions, contact samuel@turntouch.com.\n": "Turn Touch for Android — 隱私權政策\n生效日期：2026 年 10 月 16 日\n\nTurn Touch for Android 可將您的 Turn Touch Bluetooth 遙控器連線至您在手機或平板電腦上設定的操作。使用此應用程式不需要 Turn Touch 帳戶。\n\n裝置上的資訊\n\n遙控器名稱、Bluetooth 位址、電池電量、按鈕指派和連線設定皆儲存在您的裝置上。整合服務的憑證會以 Android Keystore 金鑰加密。Android 自動備份功能已停用。應用程式會在本機保留近期連線和操作診斷資料，不會將其傳送給 Turn Touch。\n\n您選擇的連線\n\n應用程式會將指令傳送至您設定的智慧家庭裝置和服務。這些服務可能包括 Hue、Nanoleaf、Sonos、Govee、Kasa、WeMo、Bose、IFTTT，以及您自己的 HTTP 端點。視整合方式而定，指令會經由本機網路或服務提供者的雲端服務傳送。請求可能包含您提供的裝置識別碼、驗證憑證、操作設定或 webhook 值。這些提供者會依照各自的隱私權政策處理請求。有些本機裝置使用未加密的 HTTP 或本機網路通訊協定；請僅在可信任的網路上使用。\n\n網頁內容\n\n您在應用程式內開啟的頁面會直接連線至相關網站。這些網站可能使用 Cookie，並接收您的 IP 位址、瀏覽器資訊及您輸入的任何資訊。適用的是這些網站的隱私權政策。Turn Touch 不會收到您的瀏覽內容。\n\n權限與媒體\n\n附近裝置權限可用於搜尋及連線 Bluetooth 裝置。Android 11 和更早版本需要位置權限才能掃描 Bluetooth；Turn Touch 不會取得 GPS 位置。前景服務通知可讓已配對的遙控器在應用程式於背景執行時保持可用。相機權限為選用，僅供相機功能使用。您拍攝的照片和靜音影片會儲存在裝置的媒體庫中，不會由 Turn Touch 上傳。應用程式也可調整媒體音量，並向您選擇的鬧鐘應用程式傳送鬧鐘請求。\n\n不含廣告或分析功能\n\nTurn Touch for Android 不含廣告、分析、追蹤或自動當機回報 SDK。我們不會出售您的資訊，也不會收到您的遙控器設定、憑證或拍攝媒體的副本。\n\n您的選擇\n\n您可以移除已配對的遙控器、變更整合設定，並在 Android 設定中撤銷權限。清除應用程式儲存空間或解除安裝應用程式會移除已儲存的設定和憑證。儲存在媒體庫中的照片和影片會保留，直到您將其刪除為止。傳送至第三方服務的任何資料，均受該服務提供者的保留和刪除機制規範。\n\n兒童\n\n本應用程式適合一般大眾使用，並非專為 13 歲以下兒童設計。Turn Touch 不會透過此 Android 應用程式明知而收集兒童的個人資訊。\n\n變更與聯絡方式\n\n本政策適用於 Turn Touch for Android 1.0 版。如果應用程式的資料處理方式有所變更，我們將更新本政策。如有隱私權相關問題，請聯絡 samuel@turntouch.com。\n",
  "Turn Touch now speaks 21 languages. Choose your language when you first open the app, or change it from Language at the top of Settings. Menus, actions, and settings are translated. Automatic follows your device language, with English as the fallback.": "Turn Touch 現支援 21 種語言。首次開啟 App 時可選擇語言，或前往「設定」頂端的「語言」變更。選單、操作和設定皆已翻譯。「自動」會依照裝置語言設定，並以英文為預設。",
